# CLAUDE.local.md (example)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` for your own machine-local notes. That file
is **git-ignored** and must never be committed.

> **No secrets. Ever.**
>
> Not `VAST_TOKEN`, not `VAST_PASSWORD`, not an API key, not a cluster password,
> not a token pasted "just for a minute". Credentials come from the environment
> or your OS keychain — see [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md#secrets-handling).
>
> Also keep real cluster hostnames, IPs, tenant names and view paths out of it
> where you can. Use placeholders.
>
> This file is loaded into the agent's context on every session. Treat it as
> readable by anything that reads this repository on this machine.

Everything below is optional. Delete what you do not use.

---

